; ORS "DAYKEEPER" CYCLER BOW, the core system (design 2.2): Ritual of the First God, whose hidden
; scope buff carries the Slowed on-hit and the crit record. It carries NO weapon - the bow is its own
; mw_ Kit beside it (test_integrated_weapon_shape.gd). The cp_ prefix is load-bearing (kit.gd:66).
; The LCP's core_system has no description, so there is no flavour row. SP3: the Kit's own glyph is
; the Daykeeper Cycler Bow family, shared with the mw_ Kit; Ritual of the First God is its own,
; separate family (design section 3, the two-part core power).
